<title>USA: Capital Associates Q1 shr $0.03 vs $0.01.</title>
<headline>Capital Associates Q1 shr $0.03 vs $0.01.</headline>
<dateline>LAKEWOOD, Co. 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>8/31/96		     8/31/95</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.03		    $0.01</p>
<p> Net			    138			 57</p>
<p> Revs			36,967		   31,210</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   5,325		    5,394</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Full company name is Capital Associates Inc.</p>
<p>NOTE: The first quarter results include a one-time charge of $150,000 for costs associated with Chairman James Walker's relocation to Denver, the company said.</p>
<p>Capital said in a statement its first quarter was a seasonally slow period for originations, but that originations still increased over last year's first quarter.</p>
</text>
